          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘማ ፡ ዐባይ ፡ እንተ ፡ ትነብር ፡ ውስተ ፡ ማያት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብዙኅ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በብዙ ፡ ውኃ ፡ ላይ ፡ በተቀመጠች ፡ በዚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያች ፡ ታላቅ ፡ ዘማ ፡ የሚፈረደውን ፡ ፍር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድ ፡ ና ፡ ላሳይህ ፡ አለኝ ፡ ም ፡ ፲፭ ፥ ፩ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፤ ⟪እንተ ፡ ምስሌሃ ፡ ዘመዉ ፡ ነገሥተ ፡ ምድር ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የዚህ ፡ ዓለም ፡ ነገሥታት ፡ ከሷ ፡ ጋራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደሷ ፡ የሴሰኑ ፡ አለ ፡ እሷን ፡ አብነት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አድርገው ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ በሠሩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰክሩ ፡ እለ ፡ ይነብሩ ፡ ዲበ ፡ ምድር ፡ እምነ ፡ ወይነ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዝሙታ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አበርትታ ፡ ጥላ ፡ ካጠጣቻቸው ፡ ጠጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተነሣ ፡ በምድር ፡ የሚኖሩ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ አእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምሯቸውን ፡ ያጡ ፡ አለ ፡ አብነት ፡ ሆና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ካሠራቻቸው ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ የተነሣ ፡ በም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድር ፡ የሚኖሩ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ በፍዳ ፡ በተያዙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚያች ፡ በቤተ ፡ አይሁድ ፡ የሚፈርድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባትን ፡ ፍርድ ፡ ና ፡ ላሳይህ ፡ አለኝ ፡ ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፬ ፥ ፰ ። ኤር ፡ ፶፩ ፥ ፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ ፡ ወሰደኒ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ገዳመ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ፡ በኋላ፡ መንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ አነሳሥቶ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወደ ፡ ገዳም ፡ ወሰደኝ ፡ (የራእይ ፡ ነው) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወርኢኩ ፡ ብእሲተ ፡ ትጼዐን ፡ ላዕለ ፡ አርዌ ፡ ቀይሕ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘምሉእ ፡ አስማተ ፡ ፅርፈት ፡ ዘሰብዐቱ ፡ አርእስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቲሁ ፡ ወዐሠርቱ ፡ አቅርንቲሁ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንዲት ፡ ሴት ፡ የስድብ ፡ ስም ፡ በተመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላበት፡ ሰባት ፡ ራሶች፡ ዐሥር ፡ ቀንዶች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባሉት ፡ በቀይ ፡ አውሬ ፡ ላይ ፡ ተቀምጣ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አየሁ ፡ ቤተ ፡ አይሁድ ፡ ናት ፡ በሐሳዌ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መሢሕ ፡ ሠልጥና ፡ አየሁ ፡ ም ፡ ፲፫ ፥ ፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፬ ፤ ⟪ወትለብስ ፡ ይእቲ ፡ ብእሲት ፡ ልብሰ ፡ ወርቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘቦ ፡ ሜላት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወርቀ ፡ ዘቦ ፡ ያለበት፡ ነጭ፡ ሐር ፡ ግምጃ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለብሳለች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዘቦ ፡ ለይ ፡ ወዕንቍ ፡ ክቡር ፡ ወባሕርያት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የዕንቍ ፡ የሉል ፡ ፈርፅ ፡ ያለበት ፡ ቀይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግምጃ ፡ ለብሳለች ፡ ሐተታ ፡ ቤተ ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁድ ፡ ከብዕላቸው ፡ ብዛት ፡ የተነሣ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አራት ፡ ኅብር ፡ አምስተኛ ፡ ወርቀ ፡ ዘቦ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይለብሳሉና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወትጸውር ፡ ውስተ ፡ እዴሃ ፡ ጽዋዐ ፡ ወርቅ ፡ ዘምሉእ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርኵሰ ፡ ወግማኔ ፡ ዝሙታ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእጅዋም ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ ዝሙት ፡ የተመላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በት ፡ የወርቅ ፡ ጽዋ ፡ ይዛለች ፡ ቤተ ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁድ ፡ ከብዕላቸው ፡ ብዛት ፡ የተነሣ ፡ በወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርቅ ፡ ጽዋ ፡ ይጠጣሉና ፡ ሐተታ ፡ ያነኑን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዐስበ ፡ ደነስ ፡ በማማለጃ፡ ያመጡታልና፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዐስበ ፡ ደነስ ፡ በማማለጃ ፡ ያመጡትን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይበሉበታል ፡ ይጠጡበታልና ፡ ዘምሉእ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርኵሰ ፡ ወግማኔ ፡ አለ ፡ ሕዝ ፡ ፳፰ ፥ ፲፫ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፮ ። ኤር ፡ ፶፩ ፥ ፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፭ ፤ ⟪ወጽሑፍ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ፍጽማ ፡ አስማተ ፡ ምሥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጢራ ፡ ለባቢሎን ፡ ዐባይ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የባቢሎን ፡ ኅቡዕ ፡ ስሟ ፡ በግምባሯ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተጽፏል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘይብል ፡ እሞን ፡ ለዘማት ፡ ወዘርኵሳ ፡ ለምድር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኃጥአን ፡ እናታቸው ፡ የኃጣውእ ፡ ነቃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ የምትሆን ፡ የባቢሎን ፡ ኅቡዕ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስሟ ፡ በግንባሯ ፡ ተጽፏል ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኃጥአን ፡ እናታቸው ፡ የኃጣውእ ፡ ነቃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ ናት ፡ የሚል ፡ ኅቡዕ ፡ ስሟ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተጽፏል ፡ ፪፡ ተሰ ፡ ፪፥ ፯ ። ራእ፡ ፲፬ ፥ ፰ና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፮ ፥ ፲፱ ። ዳን ፡ ፬ ፥ ፳፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
